post-it: Can't open images
symptoms:
	Image program not found
		shows: an error message when opening an image (can't find the .exe)
	Programs won't start
		shows: every program in the Windows folder lost its ".exe" and won't run
	Customer changed something
		shows: if asked, the customer says the problem appeared after something they did
	Start menu shortcut broken
		shows: an error message, or a corrupted link, when following the Start menu link to the image program
software steps:
	Open the Windows folder
	Add ".exe" back to every program
